{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgg9ZrJTZguNcXhcXuXXM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup is applied and the smoke tests passed. One setting didn't come through as I'd expect (see below).\n\n- **Project:** I used the existing `main` project as `primaryProject`. A new `ms` project couldn't go under `~/basic-memory/`, because `main` already covers that directory.\n- **Profile:** `coding`, with `repository: \"ms\"`. There's no git remote, so I used the directory name as you said.\n- **Schemas:** Coding Session, Decision and Task were already in `main`, so I left them untouched.\n- **Placement:** `main` was empty apart from `schemas/`, so I suggested a light starting structure. It uses `sessions/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `bm-remember/` and `notes/`, none of which are created until a note lands there.\n- **Shared skills:** The `memory-*` skills are installed globally with `npx skills add … -g`.\n- **Settings:** These are in `.claude/settings.local.json`, so they're personal and not meant to be committed. They turn on lifecycle-event capture and set `outputStyle` to `basic-memory`.\n- **Smoke test:** The open-decision query ran cleanly with 0 results, which is fine. The schema query returned the three schemas.\n- **Hook status:** It found the settings and reports project `main`, profile `coding` and repository `ms`. Capture events are on. The inbox has 3 pending envelopes, 0 archived, and no flush has run yet.\n- **Compact checkpoint:** `hook status` reports \"checkpoint on compact: off\", even though I set `preCompactCapture` to `\"extractive\"`. The PreCompact checkpoint may not run until that's resolved. I haven't investigated it.\n\nRecall is live now. Restart the session to activate the proactive-capture reflexes from the output style.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":862,"cache_read_input_tokens":35177,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":862},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d490b131-d6ca-4dbd-ada4-14d5462d0a8e","uuid":"670d56a5-8ad7-49cd-97ba-f23833304fc2","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:25:30.437Z","request_id":"req_011Cgg9Zr55LBwvG2UkcF283"}
